    <s:String x:Key="S_HelpEngines">ENGINES</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="S_HelpEnginesBody">• hybrid-engine — best quality (recommended).&#x0a;• vlm-engine — faster, VLM only.&#x0a;• pipeline — traditional OCR, good for scans.&#x0a;• *-http-client — VLM/hybrid via a remote GPU server.&#x0a;• paddleocr — PaddleOCR PP-StructureV3, light VRAM (~1-2GB).&#x0a;• mineru4x — MinerU 4.x basic, resident server, ~2.6GB VRAM.&#x0a;• windows-ocr — built-in Windows OCR, free, CPU, no setup. Good for text/light scans; complex tables worse than MinerU/Paddle.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="S_HelpNotes">NOTES</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="S_HelpNotesBody">• Press STOP before changing engine.&#x0a;• Failed files auto-retry once (if enabled). Default timeout 30 min/file.&#x0a;• .md results + batch-log.txt + batch-report.html are in the output folder.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="S_HelpClose">Close</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="S_HelpCliBody">MinerU25Tool.exe --autostart --src "D:\PDF" --out "D:\Results" --engine hybrid-engine&#x0a;&#x0a;--autostart : auto-start batch on launch&#x0a;--src : source PDF folder&#x0a;--out : output folder&#x0a;--engine : hybrid-engine | vlm-engine | pipeline | vlm-http-client | hybrid-http-client | paddleocr | mineru4x | windows-ocr</s:String>
